OSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjpxKGHx9KWAxXNh68BHfz4ECQQ3IcHCOkBKAg",null,null,null,[1],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["2025/08/11中午使用Uber eats外送此間拉麵店，總共叫了2碗，送來時雞白湯拉麵是放在麻辣拉麵上面的，把雞白湯拉麵拿出來時準備要再拿麻辣拉麵，發現怎麼那麼輕？結果一打開發現根本就沒湯？請問我的湯是消失了嗎？\n袋子完全沒有像是湯灑出來的痕跡，感覺就像是有裝過湯但湯被倒掉了？\n打電話給該店反應，接電話的店員是說他們出去都一定會有湯，要我們跟外送員反應，我就想問請問現在是外送員會特地把雞白湯拉麵先拿起來，然後把麻辣湯喝掉嗎？也太勤奮了吧？再來，外送員也是一拿到我的餐點就馬上送到我家，外送員騎車速度跟平常騎到我家時間差不多，不太可能中途把湯處理掉吧？還有，已經完成的單子根本就聯絡不到外送員，外送平台以顧客方面也很難可以跟真人客服聯絡，難道店家不知道嗎？\n該店居然多次表示要跟外送方反應，問該店那我現在就是沒收到湯也不能吃了對吧？該店居然只回我：對\n真是令人傻眼！\n對了！之前也有一次在該店叫外送是叫雞胸肉的拉麵結果送來叉燒，總之要叫這家店的請三思，有可能會收到消失的湯或者不是你叫的餐點喔～\n根本不想翻舊帳，只是剛剛該店的邏輯實在是太傻眼",null,[0,142]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6987952400726055880/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXZDJSSGRISmFWMlJhVldwS1lXSlliRzlQUlZwUFUyc3hUVTVIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6987952400726055880/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXZDJSSGRISmFWMlJhVldwS1lXSlliRzlQUlZwUFUyc3hUVTVIWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6987952400726055880/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXZDJSSGRISmFWMlJhVldwS1lXSlliRzlQUlZwUFUyc3hUVTVIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6987952400726055880/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXZDJSSGRISmFWMlJhVldwS1lXSlliRzlQUlZwUFUyc3hUVTVIWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6987952400726055880/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXZDJSSGRISmFWMlJhVldwS1lXSlliRzlQUlZwUFUyc3hUVTVIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6987952400726055880/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRXZDJSSGRISmFWMlJhVldwS1lXSlliRzlQUlZwUFUyc3hUVTVIWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,5277,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWd2RHdHJaV2RaVWpKYWJYbG9PRVpPU2sxTU5HYx